Third-party notices
===================

Midas core (crates/midas-core) adapts code from FigCraft. Everything else Midas depends on keeps its own licence.


FigCraft
--------

Source:    FigCraft 0.18.1 (workspace version), local checkout of the FigCraft repository
Licence:   MIT OR Apache-2.0, at the user's option. Midas uses it under the MIT licence below.
Copyright: (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the FigCraft contributors

Adapted into:

  crates/midas-core/src/stroke.rs
    from figcraft_pathops (`stroke_outline_of`, `stroke_center`, `rounded_side_strokes`, `dash_pattern`, `closed`)
    and figcraft_render::draw (`stroke_area`, `stroke_rule`: the per-side route, the ring shortcut, the general outline).
    Changed: Midas names and defaults (round joins and caps), one dash and one gap, dashes run as written (not fitted to an open line),
    no arrowheads, width profiles, brushes, vector-network point styles or corner smoothing, errors as `Result`, an even-odd operand
    flattened before the boolean.

  crates/midas-core/src/geom.rs
    from figcraft_geom (`arc_tolerance`, `finite_path`, `split_subpaths`, the rounded and elliptical rectangle builders).
    Changed: a command list (`M`, `L`, `C`, `Z`, `E`, `R`) as input; SVG path data as output.

  crates/midas-core/src/paint.rs
    from figcraft_color (the `Paint` / `PaintKind` split into solid, gradient, image and pattern paints with opacity, visibility and a blend
    mode; the pattern cell and the image adjustment set).
    Changed: reads and writes the JSON Midas stores; adds a Video paint (Midas only); SVG paint servers are new (angular and diamond
    gradients are never written as a radialGradient: they fall back to the first stop's colour).

Not taken: anything under FigCraft's docs/brand/ (the ArtCraft name, wordmark and logos are trademarks of the ArtCraft Team, not open
